{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zozo and The Lost Dreams is a 2D Metroidvania platformer inspired by classic Sunday-morning cartoons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter Zozo\u2019s Dream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Zozo, a 13-year-old boy who dreams of becoming a superhero\u2014 literally and figuratively. Through the help of Zozo\u2019s mad scientist neighbor, Professor Aisha, Zozo is able to enter his dreams and live out his fantasy of becoming a superhero. However, a strange incident prevents him from waking up! Zozo must now go on an adventure to find his way back home. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.poster.avif?t=1770864821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.webm?t=1770864821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.mp4?t=1770864821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Imaginative and Vibrant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re in the mood for scaling mountainous cupcakes or eliminating predatory computer \u2018bugs\u2019, each dream has its own distinct visuals and theme inspired by various cartoon tropes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/000341e763e41191424af479f79b628f.poster.avif?t=1770864821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/000341e763e41191424af479f79b628f.webm?t=1770864821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/000341e763e41191424af479f79b628f.mp4?t=1770864821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make New Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In his journey, Zozo encounters many faces\u2014 both friendly and otherwise. Aid them in their quirky hijinks and form lasting bonds. Work together with a colorful cast of characters to uncover a sinister plot that threatens to take away all of Zozo\u2019s dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/497ecbd8fb67e37fcc65ad052b1b2dce.poster.avif?t=1770864821\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/497ecbd8fb67e37fcc65ad052b1b2dce.webm?t=1770864821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/497ecbd8fb67e37fcc65ad052b1b2dce.mp4?t=1770864821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3230120?t=1770864821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/0cf3430fbfc2bfe4f40f24f2aa445c374a9066ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770864821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/62c7e3e5a0a1ca15fa472c75f993a757c9adc5f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770864821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/62c7e3e5a0a1ca15fa472c75f993a757c9adc5f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770864821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6